Language: en-GB
Description: Fits reduced-rank generalised dissimilarity models (rrGDM), in which
    the dissimilarity between sites is described by their distance in a
    low-dimensional latent space. Site positions can depend on environmental
    predictors and random effects, and the dispersion of sites around their
    expected positions can be modelled too. This gives model-based ordination
    and dissimilarity regression in a single framework. Models are fitted by
    maximum likelihood with the Laplace approximation, using 'TMB' (Template
    Model Builder).
